/*
================================================================================
DIVERSIFIED PLUS — SINGLE ORGANIZED CSS FILE
================================================================================
Active file: assets/css/diversified-plus-organized.css

Organization:
1. Global non-visual base
2. Shared foundation / shared components
3. Homepage-only CSS scoped to body.dp-page-index
4. Inner-page CSS scoped to body.dp-non-home-page
5. Mobile and responsive rules remain inside the same relevant section

Editing rule:
- Edit shared components only when the change should apply sitewide.
- Edit homepage rules under the homepage section only when the change is for the home page.
- Edit inner-page rules under the inner-page section only when the change is for service, project, blog, about, contact, or news pages.
- Every selector is separated. No comma-stacked page/component selectors are used in the organized sections.
- CSS custom variable root declarations were removed and values were inlined.
- Forced-priority declarations were removed.

Brand navy used throughout: #002949
================================================================================
*/

